tal spending of $288 million (computed from two filed figures). That is 12.3% of revenue. In FY2020 it was $2.9 billion.","cites":["CTSH.ocf.2025","CTSH.capex.2025","CTSH.revenue.2025","CTSH.ocf.2020","CTSH.capex.2020"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $181 million in FY2025, 0.9% of revenue, against 1.4% in FY2020.","cites":["CTSH.sbc.2025","CTSH.revenue.2025","CTSH.sbc.2020","CTSH.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2025 the company paid $1.4 billion to repurchase its own shares and $610 million in dividends: $2 billion together (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["CTSH.buybacks.2025","CTSH.dividends.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-30 revenue was $5.7 billion, up 4.6% from $5.4 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-30.","cites":["CTSH.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","CTSH.d.revenue.2025-07-01.2025-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-30 revenue added up to $21.9 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $3.4 billion and net income to $2.6 billion.","cites":["CTSH.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","CTSH.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","CTSH.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","CTSH.d.revenue.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","CTSH.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","CTSH.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","CTSH.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","CTSH.d.opinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","CTSH.d.opinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","CTSH.d.opinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","CTSH.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","CTSH.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","CTSH.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","CTSH.d.netinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","CTSH.d.netinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $2.4 billion: operating cash flow of $2.7 billion less capital spending of $331 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["CTSH.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","CTSH.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","CTSH.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","CTSH.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","CTSH.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-09-30","CTSH.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","CTSH.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","CTSH.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","CTSH.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","CTSH.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $6.3 billion at the end of FY2025, against $4.9 billion a year earlier. That is 29.7% of FY2025 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["CTSH.rpo.2025","CTSH.rpo.2024","CTSH.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $538 million at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $480 million a year earlier.","cites":["CTSH.deferred.2025","CTSH.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 351,600 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $60,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["CTSH.q.employees","CTSH.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $1.9 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $13 million in short-term investments, and $576 million of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + ShortTermBorrowings). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $1.3 billion (computed from four filed figures).","cites":["CTSH.cash.2025","CTSH.sti.2025","CTSH.debtLong.2025","CTSH.debtShort.2025"]}]},"fin":{"CTSH":{}},"quotes":{"CTSH.q.employees":{"c":"CTSH","kind":"employees","n":351600,"quote":"As of December 31, 2025, we had approximately 351,600 employees, with 256,900 in India, 41,600 in North America, 14,600 in Continental Europe, 7,800 in the United Kingdom and 30,700 in various other locations throughout the rest of the world.","source":"CTSH-0001058290-26-000008","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-02-12","proof":"242764cbd1103722afaaef096ba773670c64e5f11410116a9a3d8bbc7e1fdc80"}}}